{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["צדקה ממני — more than me. For I commanded her to sit in her father's house until Shelah grows up; she fulfilled the condition I commanded her, but I did not fulfill for her the condition I set for her, for I did not give her to Shelah my son. And similarly: ״על צדקו נפשו מאלהים״ — more than Elohim. And similarly with Shaul: ״ויאמר אל דוד צדיק אתה ממני״ — more than me." "ולא יסף — and he did not add. For if you interpret it as 'and he did not cease,' it should have written ולא יסף. — alternatively: יסוף עוד [מ]לדעתה."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {1 "The alternative reading (נ\"א) is textually difficult; rendered hyper-literally. The syntax appears corrupt or truncated."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:41.111733533Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}